[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 5.7,
    "text": "What happens when a legendary warlord gives away his entire personal fortune on his deathbed?",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0001",
    "index": 1
  },
  {
    "start": 5.7,
    "end": 9.5,
    "text": "Witness the transfer of a massive empire,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0002",
    "index": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 9.5,
    "end": 13.3,
    "text": "the divine blueprints for a breathtaking sanctuary,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0003",
    "index": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 13.3,
    "end": 17.16,
    "text": "and the glorious final days of the greatest king who ever",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0004",
    "index": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 17.16,
    "end": 20.02,
    "text": "lived. At the height of his power,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0005",
    "index": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 20.02,
    "end": 24.18,
    "text": "the great king organized his vast empire into a flawless,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0006",
    "index": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 24.18,
    "end": 27.94,
    "text": "unstoppable machine. To protect the borders,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0007",
    "index": 7
  },
  {
    "start": 27.94,
    "end": 31.35,
    "text": "he established a massive rotating army.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0008",
    "index": 8
  },
  {
    "start": 31.35,
    "end": 35.72,
    "text": "Every single month of the year, a fresh division of 24 ,000 elite",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0009",
    "index": 9
  },
  {
    "start": 35.72,
    "end": 38.05,
    "text": "warriors went on duty.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0010",
    "index": 10
  },
  {
    "start": 38.05,
    "end": 41.96,
    "text": "He also appointed brilliant overseers to manage the empire's vast",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0011",
    "index": 11
  },
  {
    "start": 41.96,
    "end": 46.32,
    "text": "wealth, placing trusted officials in charge of the royal storehouses,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0012",
    "index": 12
  },
  {
    "start": 46.32,
    "end": 51.28,
    "text": "the sprawling vineyards, the olive groves, and the massive herds of camels",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0013",
    "index": 13
  },
  {
    "start": 51.28,
    "end": 55.18,
    "text": "and livestock. stock. But as his twilight years approached,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0014",
    "index": 14
  },
  {
    "start": 55.18,
    "end": 58.42,
    "text": "the aging king knew his time was running out.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0015",
    "index": 15
  },
  {
    "start": 58.42,
    "end": 61.98,
    "text": "He summoned every tribal leader, military commander,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0016",
    "index": 16
  },
  {
    "start": 61.98,
    "end": 67.02,
    "text": "and brave warrior to the capital for one final historic assembly.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0017",
    "index": 17
  },
  {
    "start": 67.02,
    "end": 71.06,
    "text": "Rising to his feet, the king revealed his heart's deepest desire",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0018",
    "index": 18
  },
  {
    "start": 71.06,
    "end": 75.64,
    "text": "to build a magnificent permanent resting place for the sacred artifact.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0019",
    "index": 19
  },
  {
    "start": 75.64,
    "end": 79.54,
    "text": "But the Almighty stopped me, the king declared to the silent",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0020",
    "index": 20
  },
  {
    "start": 79.54,
    "end": 82.12,
    "text": "crowd. The divine said to me,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0021",
    "index": 21
  },
  {
    "start": 82.12,
    "end": 86.04,
    "text": "you are a warrior and have shed too much blood on the earth.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0022",
    "index": 22
  },
  {
    "start": 86.04,
    "end": 89.68,
    "text": "You are not to build a house for my name.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0023",
    "index": 23
  },
  {
    "start": 89.68,
    "end": 92.96,
    "text": "Instead, the almighty had chosen the king's son,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0024",
    "index": 24
  },
  {
    "start": 92.96,
    "end": 98.8,
    "text": "the young prince of peace, to inherit the eternal throne and construct the ultimate sanctenary.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0025",
    "index": 25
  },
  {
    "start": 98.8,
    "end": 102.44,
    "text": "Right there in front of the entire nation,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0026",
    "index": 26
  },
  {
    "start": 102.44,
    "end": 106.5,
    "text": "the aging king handed the young Prince the Master blueprints.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0027",
    "index": 27
  },
  {
    "start": 106.5,
    "end": 110.5,
    "text": "These were no ordinary architectural plans.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0028",
    "index": 28
  },
  {
    "start": 110.5,
    "end": 114.94,
    "text": "Every single detail had been placed into the king's mind directly",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0029",
    "index": 29
  },
  {
    "start": 114.94,
    "end": 117.0,
    "text": "by the divine spirit.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0030",
    "index": 30
  },
  {
    "start": 117.0,
    "end": 121.8,
    "text": "The scrolls contained the exact layouts of the inner rooms, the treasuries,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0031",
    "index": 31
  },
  {
    "start": 121.8,
    "end": 126.26,
    "text": "and the precise, required weights of pure gold and silver for every",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0032",
    "index": 32
  },
  {
    "start": 126.26,
    "end": 129.52,
    "text": "single lampstand, table, and sprinkling bowl.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0033",
    "index": 33
  },
  {
    "start": 129.52,
    "end": 133.72,
    "text": "It even included the breathtaking design for a golden chariot",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0034",
    "index": 34
  },
  {
    "start": 133.72,
    "end": 139.0,
    "text": "of winged guardians that would overshadow the sacred artifact.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0035",
    "index": 35
  },
  {
    "start": 139.0,
    "end": 142.64,
    "text": "Knowing his son was young and the task was monumental,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0036",
    "index": 36
  },
  {
    "start": 142.64,
    "end": 145.2,
    "text": "the king led by a radical example.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0037",
    "index": 37
  },
  {
    "start": 145.2,
    "end": 149.78,
    "text": "He gave away his entire personal private treasure to the project three",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0038",
    "index": 38
  },
  {
    "start": 149.78,
    "end": 154.8,
    "text": "thousand talents of the purest gold and seven thousand talents of refined silver.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0039",
    "index": 39
  },
  {
    "start": 154.8,
    "end": 158.28,
    "text": "Inspired by the king's staggering generosity,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0040",
    "index": 40
  },
  {
    "start": 158.28,
    "end": 162.44,
    "text": "the tribal leaders and commanders joyfully stepped forward.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0041",
    "index": 41
  },
  {
    "start": 162.44,
    "end": 166.6,
    "text": "Together, they freely surrendered an unimaginable fortune over",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0042",
    "index": 42
  },
  {
    "start": 166.6,
    "end": 170.76,
    "text": "5 ,000 talents of gold, 10 ,000 talents of silver,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0043",
    "index": 43
  },
  {
    "start": 170.76,
    "end": 175.52,
    "text": "and mountains of precious stones, bronze, and iron.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0044",
    "index": 44
  },
  {
    "start": 175.52,
    "end": 178.66,
    "text": "Overwhelmed with joy by his people's willing hearts,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0045",
    "index": 45
  },
  {
    "start": 178.66,
    "end": 183.04,
    "text": "the aging king offered a beautiful historic prayer in front of the assembly.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0046",
    "index": 46
  },
  {
    "start": 183.04,
    "end": 187.56,
    "text": "Who am I, and who are my people that we should be able",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0047",
    "index": 47
  },
  {
    "start": 187.56,
    "end": 191.36,
    "text": "to give as generously as this? He wept.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0048",
    "index": 48
  },
  {
    "start": 191.36,
    "end": 194.44,
    "text": "Wealth and honor come from you alone.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0049",
    "index": 49
  },
  {
    "start": 194.44,
    "end": 199.86,
    "text": "Everything comes from your hand, and we have only given back what already belongs to you.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0050",
    "index": 50
  },
  {
    "start": 199.86,
    "end": 205.2,
    "text": "The following day, the nation offered thousands of sacrifices and celebrated",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0051",
    "index": 51
  },
  {
    "start": 205.2,
    "end": 210.14,
    "text": "with massive feasts. They officially anointed the young prince as the new",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0052",
    "index": 52
  },
  {
    "start": 210.14,
    "end": 214.39,
    "text": "supreme ruler, and he took his seat on the royal throne.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0053",
    "index": 53
  },
  {
    "start": 214.39,
    "end": 217.94,
    "text": "Having reigned in unprecedented power for forty years,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0054",
    "index": 54
  },
  {
    "start": 217.94,
    "end": 222.14,
    "text": "the legendary warrior king finally died at a good old age,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0055",
    "index": 55
  },
  {
    "start": 222.14,
    "end": 225.61,
    "text": "full of long life, wealth, and honor.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0056",
    "index": 56
  },
  {
    "start": 225.61,
    "end": 228.88,
    "text": "He left behind a perfectly unified empire,",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0057",
    "index": 57
  },
  {
    "start": 228.88,
    "end": 233.4,
    "text": "unimaginable riches, and a peaceful heir ready to build the greatest",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0058",
    "index": 58
  },
  {
    "start": 233.4,
    "end": 236.14,
    "text": "sanctuary the world had ever seen.",
    "type": "speech",
    "scene_id": "S0059",
    "index": 59
  }
]